                        "entry_id": "17de30ee-d6a7-32ba-bae7-0b69b059c1d1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In a way characterized by addition (of increments) rather than multiplication (by factors) or exponentiation (by exponents): by an arithmetic progression."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "of the nature of increases or decreases"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "41050282-251c-4c54-bfa7-b6b1418f6270",
                                "sense_id": "8da5f46b-3f77-3e8e-a77f-1b87108413ca",
                                "text": "Over the past decade the business has grown arithmetically, which shows that it is serving a demand successfully; but because it has not grown exponentially, its growth is viewed by some investors as \"not good enough.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3031f39a-96fb-39f7-8afc-8c14dc478e07",
                        "entry_id": "17de30ee-d6a7-32ba-bae7-0b69b059c1d1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In terms of arithmetic."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
