                                "sense_id": "3031f39a-96fb-39f7-8afc-8c14dc478e07",
                                "text": "The two terms are arithmetically equivalent, but they are not equally intuitive regarding what phenomenon they represent in the real world."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
